{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fmnFhJ-GtZ9bLydILbDQOw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:41.910353+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fmnFhJ-GtZ9bLydILbDQOw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>广东外语外贸大学</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>日语语言文化学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>（东方学研究院）</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2027年接收推免研究生</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>预报名通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUmG4XbcnG4LaSiaDvS5x7fwGibeS9grBeTm4v9PYsBFwGPyzVIJib6y9jcCrnUfb9fwqynh2ZsqyHrfsPYRcBckhPnicmljJnYjX9I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUlic8MYM5X7k8PnXZic9rbxTCLU3rePIt2ITpGQNDoiarumwxMuGAiaLK9SiaxVLsibOBT0yO4ib2Cqj8PoSJoabvZgmGLkeM6OEm1ibnA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/YtiaflZHjsUmoZQhYFIxRHkHic3Cib3bMsY0bGqh2TTptnI2NVXsBxiahvVf989ycsbNlm3icsvc8VgprpibW6af18ZX9ZptXncCkH7Y4EE0mVaBg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUnO8OVcmU7otn7btJqT56yrAJRINpiboF4gzfBQw4vAF4NhpGX0zHlZ8ToupCXBZAYpfEvbOTG0WiafR5ibCQz13c50ibibicLEibTYOo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>广东外语外贸大学日语语言文化学院（东方学研究院）前身为成立于1970年10月的广州外国语学院“三系”。1983年，院系调整时更名为东语系。1995年5月，原属教育部直接管辖的广州外国语学院与原属对外经贸部直接管辖的广州对外贸易学院合并，东语系升格为东方语言文化学院。2018年7月，学院再次升格为日语语言文化学院。2026年1月，学院名称拓展为日语语言文化学院（东方学研究院）。</span></p><p><span>日语专业为教育部特色专业，是全国唯一获批教育部日语专业虚拟教研室的专业，也是首批国家级一流本科专业建设点，广东省唯一的日语名牌专业。亚洲校园教育中心是中国涉外型大学中唯一获批此项目的教学单位。</span></p><p><span>学院现有教职工50名。专任教师中，有教授17人、副教授9人；博士生导师7人，硕士生导师30人，形成了阵容强大、梯队合理、学术水平高、教学经验丰富并在同类院校中具有较高知名度和影响力的师资队伍。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUmmbwv1z8t6rED6vGYtDjBePx4CzFU5ACFd8AIskCjVGGQDY1dHBtm68gBVySHB9ZOxnE3uavVv6KGLglrducQOPE7GHrQdTjk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUkZfAtGnOFficKp1gZdDRnN5S2gyw26IygdeHqib1jicshibiaqmP3Gy8WzmLCliad7PeVEqejd9icclRC4M4yIQ4yS0vhl1kU9ncKrTg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/YtiaflZHjsUkVWxfKv7rICS1DO8zafbsnWXdLlYJWpQmJBFWNZEjptTrrI5ticZcGzyBrXvIDPRMkJ8wqzrpdvWKRa06LSe8gJ3xv06xGazvU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><span>专业名称</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>培养特色</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><section><p><span>日语语言文学</span></p><p><span>(050205)</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>◆本专业自1978年开始招收硕士研究生。旨在培养具有坚实理论基础知识和系统专业知识，能独立从事研究、教学，以及国际交流、跨文化商务沟通等工作的日语高级人才。</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>◆专业分为五个方向：</span></p><p><span>(1) 中日比较文学与东方学研究、</span></p><p><span>(2) 数字人文与翻译学研究、</span></p><p><span>(3) 日语语言及教育研究、</span></p><p><span>(4) 日本社会与文化研究、</span></p><p><span>(5) 东亚区域国别研究。</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>日语笔译</span></p><p><span>(055105)</span></p></section></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><section><p><span>◆2012年，日语口译专业硕士（MTI）开始正式招生。</span><span><br/></span><span>◆2024年，日语笔译专业硕士（MTI）开始正式招生。</span><span><br/></span><span>◆日语MTI学科立足人工智能与数字化时代，聚焦翻译实践与智能技术的深度融合。核心课程涵盖同声传译、交替传译、政务与经贸翻译，并系统引入人工智能辅助翻译、语料库辅助翻译及翻译研究方法论。课程设置注重真实场景模拟与技术工具应用，突出翻译实践的质量把控与职业素养训练。</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>日语口译</span></p><p><span>(055106)</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUlYR8nv3dULsAgIESiao1wMJJRibV0IUIrZdlk77jlH6iclIyrKM5rGaqj72EPhqZQWVfBlFuhaDm1nzw5Y8noM8VoDlSG8Hib8dT0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUlfCMBicZKQ3XtiavALTDNoI3O4mHLSqduUlKd2qEJd0caAbsgFcVE6kmOKRaBv7fvvyyOx4e22YCU5Z26BWLfN9ExP1IjJOLYuI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/YtiaflZHjsUk3AvvmeAUcN2CCuzJdksT2cicdjw2BZ60T0jfvs8e2cibCpHljmQgibguvTR4a6SHwwFRE5iaQRpm9C9rtfiaRAbB1BvvGOzH5kGPs/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>（一）推免生须于9月4日15:00—9月17日12:00登录广东外语外贸大学研招系统（网址：https://yanzhao.gdufs.edu.cn/kspt/）预报名；9月11日—17日日语语言文化学院审核回复考生是否获得复试资格；复试时间由研究院具体通知。</span></p><p><span>推免生资格审核确认、报考、录取以及备案公开等相关工作，最终均须通过教育部“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）进行。</span></p><p><span>（二）确认参加复试的考生须在规定时间内参加复试，逾期不参加的将视为放弃。复试时须提交以下材料以供资格审查：</span></p><p><span>1. 本人身份证；</span></p><p><span>2. 学生证；</span></p><p><span>3. 研究生招生思想政治和品德表现审查表；</span></p><p><span>4. 本科学习期间的成绩单（大一到大三期间）；</span></p><p><span>5. 外语等级证书；</span></p><p><span>6. 获奖证书等材料。</span></p><p><span>（三）考生收到复试通知后，须自行在广东外语外贸大学研究生招生信息网（网址：http:yz.gdufs.edu.cn）下载体检表，自行前往二级甲等以上医院体检，并于复试时将体检表与其他报名材料一并提交研究院审核。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUm41PKBVY8ib6CM9N7eicibUT4OylyicaeQG16ctOyKm9LyPZY0M9kgzH8xS99GBKUnfPicq5rPYnCKXdRbo97d20YKqkCibxO4AfUcU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUkGOibxO57iaS421l0FGNoH8NJppd6ibgCyHRnQPicMHsV1lMdRCtyId3pbxkZoxE3LjDjSibOoeG1N3es2OWybUqVrSo5QAWiceeQ20/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/YtiaflZHjsUnE7N5VtaIrNck6XrtNLsWIGspD387JFXXz2SjvVpsIqiangqaD1b0Ow3SibOHY2bOMfB2SKx5bdObl7vuRIicIgNrlygibDdTFy2c/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>联系人：黄老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：020-36207532</span></p><p><span>邮箱：202520019@gdufs.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>联系地址：广东外语外贸大学白云山校区一教北楼230</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUl2CJx85tPUibtQJ3xbpQfwQhPNDB5lQa9CWrwX08yewb2SmYDzicmjhextTucDtLfVNrEXSqguGYHKFoZSGGFgZOCvreC9mlNQ4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>温馨提示</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YtiaflZHjsUnQBwuaFcNwL2l4zzwn1ic90bJXOPYODborwpFh6ibMTcQVIBEmG93Qu5r6deEdBxTxuROU8fviaOCMRzDUEMHSpEYaOuGjkmh1XM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/YtiaflZHjsUlK6bJjz3Ne1OAGEZzBunCMSD0ic6icZ6iasyHHMiaH4DiaxC0F7IExPicCvJpKD9b16haWWT60OFzjMjOPHNqFrpTEc0ab2UMR9HLxo/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>（一）在复试前，若考生尚未知晓是否获得推免生资格，可先参加我院复试。</span></p><p><span>（二）参加复试后，若考生取得当年推免生资格，则复试成绩有效；若未取得推免生资格，则复试成绩无效。</span></p><p><span>（三）更多报名相关信息，详见研究生院官网<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fmnFhJ-GtZ9bLydILbDQOw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eECxdlMqW4KHrfFw4-fDew</a></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>以及我院微信公众号<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fmnFhJ-GtZ9bLydILbDQOw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TNC6utLQTwTuk3S17HcQqw</a>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/YtiaflZHjsUmic5dHTWS3jibAh9CTEAXwaqayBgNm8cVsC4c2icn7vz9DVVhticJgTxogDgm2JkxxVib9XHvl25e6WibOoRiatzicbSMJUVyyPIc0CcU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>= END =</span></strong></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b373cb470878caa358f28535cd4aa1ec8d675da37bd97163c00d92079ef3e977","textLength":1597,"sourceSha256":"0685e352cf653e45f5a222fbf04ab4af6095d789e225f2ff50cd140923322a3b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d872c554d64a56dd5357","title":"2026年广东外语外贸大学日语语言文化学院（东方学研究院）2027年接收推免研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:41.910353+00:00"}
